{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 129,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.4111328125,
        513.471923828125,
        96.03863525390625
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary TB (EPTB)  refers to any bacteriologically confirmed or clinically",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        98.68365478515625,
        513.4374389648438,
        112.03515625
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed case of TB involving organs other than the lungs, e.g. pleura, lymph nodes,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        114.68017578125,
        398.1730041503906,
        128.03167724609375
      ],
      "text": "abdomen, genitourinary tract, skin, joints and bones, meninges.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        140.85150146484375,
        510.2353820800781,
        157.57949829101562
      ],
      "text": "Classification based on history of previous TB treatment (patient registra-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        155.25152587890625,
        151.69940185546875,
        171.97952270507812
      ],
      "text": "tion group)",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        178.99102783203125,
        513.4490356445312,
        192.342529296875
      ],
      "text": "Classifications based on history of previous TB treatment are slightly different from",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        194.987548828125,
        513.448974609375,
        208.33905029296875
      ],
      "text": "those previously published. They focus only on history of previous treatment and are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        210.98406982421875,
        513.426025390625,
        224.3355712890625
      ],
      "text": "independent of bacteriological confirmation or site of disease. Note also that the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        226.91159057617188,
        363.2474060058594,
        240.33209228515625
      ],
      "text": "(1, 2) registration groups for DR-TB are slightly different  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        251.21112060546875,
        513.368408203125,
        264.838623046875
      ],
      "text": "New patients  have never been treated for TB or have taken anti-TB drugs for less than",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        267.2076416015625,
        136.8009033203125,
        280.83514404296875
      ],
      "text": "1 month.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        291.71417236328125,
        513.4375610351562,
        305.3416748046875
      ],
      "text": "Previously treated patients  have received 1 month or more of anti-TB drugs in the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        307.9866943359375,
        513.3914794921875,
        321.33819580078125
      ],
      "text": "past. They are further classified by the outcome of their most recent course of treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        323.9831848144531,
        139.99790954589844,
        337.3346862792969
      ],
      "text": "as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        348.21368408203125,
        513.4833984375,
        361.8411865234375
      ],
      "text": "Relapse patients  cured  have previously been treated for TB, were declared  or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        364.41717529296875,
        513.4375,
        377.8376770019531
      ],
      "text": "treatment completed  at the end of their most recent course of treatment, and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        380.482666015625,
        513.3570556640625,
        393.83416748046875
      ],
      "text": "are now diagnosed with a recurrent episode of TB (either a true relapse or a new",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        396.4791564941406,
        289.53240966796875,
        409.8306579589844
      ],
      "text": "episode of TB caused by reinfection).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        418.2026672363281,
        513.3799438476562,
        431.8301696777344
      ],
      "text": "Treatment after failure patients  are those who have previously been treated for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        434.4061584472656,
        513.3798217773438,
        447.82666015625
      ],
      "text": "treatment failed  TB and whose  at the end of their most recent course of treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        456.19866943359375,
        513.3798828125,
        469.826171875
      ],
      "text": "Treatment after loss to follow-up patients  have previously been treated for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        472.4711608886719,
        513.4490356445312,
        485.8226623535156
      ],
      "text": "TB and were declared lost to follow-up at the end of their most recent course of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        488.3986511230469,
        489.0689392089844,
        501.81915283203125
      ],
      "text": "treatment after default treatment. (These were previously known as  patients.)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        510.191162109375,
        513.4029541015625,
        523.8186645507812
      ],
      "text": "Other previously treated patients  are those who have previously been treated",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        526.4636840820312,
        513.4373779296875,
        539.815185546875
      ],
      "text": "for TB but whose outcome after their most recent course of treatment is unknown",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33740234375,
        542.4601440429688,
        200.92489624023438,
        555.8116455078125
      ],
      "text": "or undocumented.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        564.1836547851562,
        513.4144287109375,
        577.8111572265625
      ],
      "text": "Patients with unknown previous TB treatment history  do not fit into any of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        580.4561767578125,
        202.6038818359375,
        593.8076782226562
      ],
      "text": "categories listed above.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        604.6866455078125,
        336.3948974609375,
        618.3141479492188
      ],
      "text": "incident New and relapse cases of TB are  TB cases.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        631.1712036132812,
        284.4313659667969,
        647.8992309570312
      ],
      "text": "Classification based on HIV status",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        654.6347045898438,
        513.4835815429688,
        668.26220703125
      ],
      "text": "HIV-positive TB patient  refers to any bacteriologically confirmed or clinically diagnosed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        670.9072265625,
        513.5065307617188,
        684.2587280273438
      ],
      "text": "case of TB who has a positive result from HIV testing conducted at the time of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        686.9037475585938,
        513.3682861328125,
        700.2552490234375
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis or other documented evidence of enrolment in HIV care, such as enrolment in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        702.9002075195312,
        430.970947265625,
        716.251708984375
      ],
      "text": "the pre-ART register or in the ART register once ART has been started.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        727.1307373046875,
        513.483642578125,
        740.7582397460938
      ],
      "text": "HIV-negative TB patient  refers to any bacteriologically confirmed or clinically diagnosed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        743.4031982421875,
        513.3799438476562,
        756.7546997070312
      ],
      "text": "case of TB who has a negative result from HIV testing conducted at the time of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        759.3997192382812,
        513.3916625976562,
        772.751220703125
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis. Any HIV-negative TB patient subsequently found to be HIV-positive should be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        775.396240234375,
        201.764404296875,
        788.7477416992188
      ],
      "text": "reclassified accordingly.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        8.642800331115723,
        805.8439331054688,
        42.002803802490234,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "110",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}